      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When you move household goods from Deoghar to Garhwa, the journey is governed by a set of statutory documents and a robust risk‑coverage plan. Understanding these requirements helps you avoid delays, fines, and unexpected losses, whether you hire <strong>packers and movers in Deoghar Jharkhand</strong> or a national operator.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">GST e‑Way Bill</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Every consignment of movable goods worth more than ₹50,000 must be accompanied by an e‑Way bill generated on the GST portal. The bill records the shipper, consignee, value of goods, and the vehicle’s registration. It is mandatory for gst on household goods shifting and must be presented to tax officials at any checkpoint.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑approved Lorry Receipt (LR/Bilty)</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Issued by the transporter, the LR serves as a legal contract confirming the receipt of goods, the agreed freight, and the condition of the cargo at loading. An IBA‑approved LR is recognized across states and protects you in case of disputes over loss or damage.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance – 100% Declared Value</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A comprehensive policy covering the full declared value of your items. It protects against accidental collision, fire, theft, and even unforeseen delays that could cause spoilage or additional costs. The insurance is mandatory for high‑value shipments and is issued by insurers licensed by the Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India (IRDAI).</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Choosing the right service provider matters.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Companies listed under <em>packers and movers in Deoghar</em> or <em>movers and packers Deoghar</em> typically handle the paperwork for you, ensuring the e‑Way bill and LR are correctly filed.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>If you need to <em>hire furniture movers</em> for delicate items, verify that they offer the 100% declared‑value insurance and can produce the required documents on the spot.</span></li></ul>

<p>For specialized needs, such as moving antique furniture or large appliances, you might look for <em>furniture movers Hastings</em> or firms that provide dedicated <em>trucks for home shifting</em>. These operators often bundle the statutory compliance into their service fee, which can be compared against the <em>packers and movers charges in Chattarpur</em> to gauge market rates.</p>

<p>In summary, a smooth Deoghar‑to‑Garhwa relocation hinges on three pillars: a valid GST e‑Way bill, an IBA‑approved lorry receipt, and full‑value IRDAI marine transit insurance. By confirming these elements with your chosen mover, you safeguard your belongings and enjoy a hassle‑free move.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

